  "as_of": "2026-09-10",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would exempt Knox Robodebt class action settlement payments from specified Commonwealth compensation recovery rules and from social security and veterans' income tests.",
   "It would change the legal treatment of those payments so recipients would avoid compensation repayments and income test reductions under the Social Security Act 1991 and the Veterans’ Entitlements Act 1986.",
   "The exemptions would cover fixed and individually assessed payments under the court-approved settlement distribution scheme, with the amendments starting the day after Royal Assent."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "Settlement payments would be excluded from compensation under the National Disability Insurance Scheme Act 2013.",
   "The Social Security Act 1991 would exclude the payments from both income and compensation.",
   "The Veterans' Entitlements Act 1986 would likewise exclude the payments from income and compensation."
  ],
  "affected": "Knox settlement recipients are affected.",
